<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/CSGR> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Clay, sand and gravel"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/CSH> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Clay, sandy, shelly [Unlithified Deposits Coding Scheme - Extended]"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/CSIMD> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Silicate-mud, calcareous"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/CSL> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Clay, sandy, cobbly [Unlithified Deposits Coding Scheme]"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/CSLB> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Clay, sandy, cobbly, bouldery [Unlithified Deposits Coding Scheme]"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/CSLFD> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Claystone, siltstone and ferruginous dolostone"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/CSLH> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Clay, sandy, cobbly, shelly [Unlithified Deposits Coding Scheme - Extended]"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/CSLM> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Calcareous sandstone with limestone"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/CSLST> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Siltstone, carbonaceous"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/CSLV> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Clay, sandy, cobbly, gravelly [Unlithified Deposits Coding Scheme]"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/CSMAGS> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Mylonitic calcsilicate-rock, amphibolite and gneissose semipelite"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/CSMC> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Calcareous sandstone and calcareous mudstone with conglomerate"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/CSMD> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Calcareous schist, metadolostone and metalimestone"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/CSMP> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Calcareous semipelite and micaceous psammite"@en .
