<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/CSP> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Clay, sandy, peaty [Unlithified Deposits Coding Scheme]"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/CSPV> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Clay, sandy, peaty, gravelly [Unlithified Deposits Coding Scheme]"@en .
