<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/CSSM> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Conglomerate, sandstone, siltstone and mudstone"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/CSSST> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Silicate-sandstone, coarse"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/CSST> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Sandstone, carbonaceous"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/CST> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Claystone - A type of mudstone. British Geological Survey Research Report RR/99/03, fig. 13. See: silicate-claystone."@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/CSV> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Clay, sandy, gravelly [Unlithified Deposits Coding Scheme]"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/CSVB> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Clay, sandy, gravelly, bouldery [Unlithified Deposits Coding Scheme]"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/CSVH> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Clay, sandy, gravelly, shelly [Unlithified Deposits Coding Scheme - Extended]"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/CSVL> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Clay, sandy, gravelly, cobbly [Unlithified Deposits Coding Scheme]"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/CSVLB> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Clay, sandy, gravelly, cobbly, bouldery [Unlithified Deposits Coding Scheme]"@en .
