<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/GDPSIB> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Granodiorite with psammite xenoliths (intrusion-breccia)"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/GDQM> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Granodiorite and quartz-monzodiorite"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/GDSP> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Granodiorite with rafts of semipelite"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/GDTM> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Gabbro, diorite, tonalite, monzonite and granite"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/GDTN> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Granodiorite, tonalitic"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/GGFE> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Granophyric granite and felsite"@en .
