<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/LVSC> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Cobbles, gravelly, sandy, clayey [Unlithified Deposits Coding Scheme]"@en .
