<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/LVZS> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Cobbles, gravelly, silty, sandy [Unlithified Deposits Coding Scheme]"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/LWACKE> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Lithic-wacke - A type of wacke. In the Rock Classification Scheme, it is defined as shown in British Geological Survey Research Report RR/99/03, section 2.2 and figs. 3, 4."@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/LZ> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Cobbles, silty [Unlithified Deposits Coding Scheme]"@en .
