<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/M> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Mud [Unlithified Deposits Coding Scheme - Extended] - A type of natural superficial deposit. The Unlithified Deposits Coding Scheme - Extended is an extension to the Unlithified Deposits Coding Scheme, for deposit types not defined in the original scheme."@en .
