<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/MAG> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Magnetitite - A type of rock of restricted mineralogy. In the Rock Classification Scheme, it is a coarse-grained crystalline igneous rock in which magnetite exceeds 90% of the mineral mode. British Geological Survey Research Report RR/99/06, section 8.2."@en .
