<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/MUDM> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Mud (Sea bed sediment, based on Folk) - A type of marine sediment. British Geological Survey Research Report RR/99/04, table 8c. Symbol: M"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/MUDSGV> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Gravel, muddy sandy (Sea bed sediment, based on Folk) - A type of marine sediment. British Geological Survey Research Report RR/99/04, table 8c. Symbol: msG"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/MUDSND> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Sand, muddy (Sea bed sediment, based on Folk) - A type of marine sediment. British Geological Survey Research Report RR/99/04, table 8c. Symbol: mS"@en .
