<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/VLBCS> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Gravel, cobbly, bouldery, clayey, sandy [Unlithified Deposits Coding Scheme]"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/VLBS> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Gravel, cobbly, bouldery, sandy [Unlithified Deposits Coding Scheme]"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/VLBSC> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Gravel, cobbly, bouldery, sandy, clayey [Unlithified Deposits Coding Scheme]"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/VLBSZ> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Gravel, cobbly, bouldery, sandy, silty [Unlithified Deposits Coding Scheme]"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/VLBZ> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Gravel, cobbly, bouldery, silty [Unlithified Deposits Coding Scheme]"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/VLBZS> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Gravel, cobbly, bouldery, silty, sandy [Unlithified Deposits Coding Scheme]"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/VLC> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Gravel, cobbly, clayey [Unlithified Deposits Coding Scheme]"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/VLCS> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Gravel, cobbly, clayey, sandy [Unlithified Deposits Coding Scheme]"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/VLH> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Gravel, cobbly, shelly [Unlithified Deposits Coding Scheme - Extended]"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/VLP> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Gravel, cobbly, peaty [Unlithified Deposits Coding Scheme]"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/VLS> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Gravel, cobbly, sandy [Unlithified Deposits Coding Scheme]"@en .
